    "body": "```\r\n➜  starship --version && echo \"hi mom\" | grep asdf\r\n+_zsh_highlight_preexec_hook:2> typeset -g _ZSH_HIGHLIGHT_PRIOR_BUFFER=''\r\n+_zsh_highlight_preexec_hook:3> typeset -gi _ZSH_HIGHLIGHT_PRIOR_CURSOR=''\r\n+starship_preexec:1> __starship_get_time\r\n+__starship_get_time:1> ((  STARSHIP_CAPTURED_TIME = int(rint(EPOCHREALTIME * 1000))  ))\r\n+starship_preexec:1> STARSHIP_START_TIME=1647283114832\r\n+-zsh:4> starship --version\r\nstarship 1.4.2\r\nbranch:\r\ncommit_hash:\r\nbuild_time:2022-03-10 18:01:38 +00:00\r\nbuild_env:rustc 1.59.0,\r\n+-zsh:4> echo 'hi mom'\r\n+-zsh:4> grep asdf\r\n+_direnv_hook:1> trap -- '' SIGINT\r\n+_direnv_hook:2> /Users/christophernajewicz/.asdf/installs/direnv/2.28.0/bin/direnv export zsh\r\n+_direnv_hook:2> eval ''\r\n+_direnv_hook:3> trap - SIGINT\r\n+_zsh_highlight_main__precmd_hook:3> setopt localoptions\r\n+_zsh_highlight_main__precmd_hook:4> eval '[[ -o warnnestedvar ]]'\r\n+(eval):1> [[ -o warnnestedvar ]]\r\n+_zsh_highlight_main__precmd_hook:8> _zsh_highlight_main__command_type_cache=( )\r\n+starship_precmd:2> STARSHIP_CMD_STATUS=1 STARSHIP_PIPE_STATUS=( 0 1 )\r\n+starship_precmd:6> ((  1  ))\r\n+starship_precmd:7> __starship_get_time\r\n+__starship_get_time:1> ((  STARSHIP_CAPTURED_TIME = int(rint(EPOCHREALTIME * 1000))  ))\r\n+starship_precmd:7> ((  STARSHIP_DURATION = STARSHIP_CAPTURED_TIME - STARSHIP_START_TIME  ))\r\n+starship_precmd:8> unset STARSHIP_START_TIME\r\n+starship_precmd:15> STARSHIP_JOBS_COUNT=0\r\n+-zsh:5> /usr/local/bin/starship prompt '--keymap=' '--status=1' --pipestatus 0 1 '--cmd-duration=29' '--jobs=0'\r\nerror: Found argument '1' which wasn't expected, or isn't valid in this context\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n    starship prompt [OPTIONS]\r\n\r\nFor more information try --help\r\n\r\nNOTE:\r\n    passed arguments: [\"prompt\", \"--keymap=\", \"--status=1\", \"--pipestatus\", \"0\", \"1\", \"--cmd-duration=29\", \"--jobs=0\"]\r\n\r\n```",
