    "body": "@chipbuster It looks like it's quoted in the zsh script.\r\n\r\nClap now discourages the use of `--flag 1 2` and encourages the use of separators or `--flag 1 --flag 2` instead. There is a flag to re-enable support for `--flag 1 2`, but it was preventing empty inputs from being accepted.",
