    "updated_at": "2022-03-18T13:44:07Z",
    "body": "> @chiefy Are you using `eval $(starship init zsh)` or did you dump the config to disk at some point? It looks like the pipestatus arguments are from the style that was patched out a few months ago.\r\n\r\nI did switch to `eval \"$(starship init zsh --print-full-init)\"` (thanks @yuhonas) and it fixed it. The debug I posted was after I switched it back to using `znap eval starship 'starship init zsh --print-full-init'`",
